a	2025-05-26-15-Hello2025-05-26-15-Ola.pt
t	Hello Blog
i	Alexandre Gomes Gaigalas – May 26, 2025
p	xFor a while now, I've been wanting to start a technical blog. I decided to transform this simple, hand-crafted HTML website into a platform for it.
p	xIt is as close as pure HTML as you can get. I create posts by writing the HTML by hand, and there is a 80-line (at the time of writing) kshell scriptd (href=build.sh>shell script that manages the content.)x that manages the content.
p	xI decided not to use any form of markdown or any form of templating for the solution. However, my solution has some nice tricks on its sleeve:
b	xIf I change the index.html header, the shell script updates all the post pages for me.
b	xThe script automatically selects the last five posts to highlight on index.html.
p	xThere is no manual, no repository project, no way of sharing the solution (for now). That's by design. As I (hopefully) write more often, more tools and functionality will be needed.
r	
